# egui layout gotchas

Behavioral contracts live in Example Maps — do not restate scenarios here. Before changing sizing, popups, focus, scroll, or strokes, open the relevant map and keep its greens green.

| Concern | Map |
|---------|-----|
| Nested parent popups / menus | [`docs/examples/ui/nested-popups.md`](../../docs/examples/ui/nested-popups.md) |
| Tooltip / self-sizing Area ratchet | [`docs/examples/ui/tooltip-ratchet.md`](../../docs/examples/ui/tooltip-ratchet.md) |
| Focus / keys after foreground layers | [`docs/examples/ui/focus-layers.md`](../../docs/examples/ui/focus-layers.md) |
| Dialog / layout sizing (fill vs ratchet) | [`docs/examples/ui/dialog-layout.md`](../../docs/examples/ui/dialog-layout.md) |

Index: [`docs/examples/README.md`](../../docs/examples/README.md). Headless test cookbook: `egui-interaction-testing` skill.

## Helpers (use these; extend opts — do not bypass)

| Helper | Use |
|--------|-----|
| `fill_resize_body` | Window body that must fill but stay resizable |
| `fill_row` | Fill-width field with trailing buttons on the same row |
| `visible_size` / `visible_width` / `visible_height` | Layout budget — `UiKind`-aware |
| `visible_content_width` | Width minus floating scrollbar overlay |
| `fit_dialog_popup` / `dialog_constrain_rect` | Dialog max bounds |
| `parent_popup` / `register_nested_popup` | Parent popup that stays open over nested layers |
| `confirm_cancel_row` / `confirm_choice_row` / `dismiss_row` / `save_row` | Right-aligned dialog buttons via `right_button_row` |
| `show_scroll_edge_fit` / `popup_scroll_max_height` / `dialog_scroll` | Scroll without ballooning self-sizing parents |
| `show_overflow` | Paint chrome when it fits; scroll after measured overflow |
| `focus_nav::is_top_layer` | "May this surface take keys" — immune to lingering closed Areas |
| `consume_escape` | Esc closes the topmost layer only |

`sqyre-overlay` cannot import `sqyre-app`; keep picker layout local (see `icons.rs`).
